            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anuran Evolution: Frog of War </strong>is a fast-paced third person shooter where you have a chaotic even with friends playing as battle hardened frogs fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into compact battlefields with your friends, scramble for weapons and gear, and outplay rival frogs through smart positioning, fast looting, and chaotic combat. Every match is designed to create tense standoffs, sudden reversals, and ridiculous frog-fueled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're ambushing from cover, rushing for better loot, or desperately trying to outlast your friends in the final showdown, <strong>Frog of War</strong> delivers the thrill of a battle royale in a smaller, faster, and more chaotic format, without the downtime of a full-scale match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, compact battle royale matches built for quick sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer frog combat with firearms, gear, and chaotic amphibious action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and out fit your frog in a variety of outfits and cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, reposition, and survive escalating chaos to become the last frog standing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across atmospheric, stylized locations ranging from forests and farmlands to quiet small towns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
